              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Herode bwe yategeera nga bamutebwike, yaasungughala ekibitiriire era yaalagira okwita abaana abalenzi boonaboona ab'emyaka ebiri n'okwika ghansi abaali mu Bethelehemu n'ebiketezo ebikiriinaine, okusinziira ku biseera bye yali amaze okukakasa obukalamu n'abasaadha bale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo ni kyatuukirira omulanzi Yeremia kye yakoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Herode bwe yamala okufa, malaika wa Musengwa yaabonekera Yosefu mu kirooto, e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamukoba ati: “Situka ogeme ku mwana n'inhina muje mu nsi ya Isiraeli, kuba abaali banoonia okwita omwana bamaze okufa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Yosefu yaasituka yaagema ku mwana n'inhina yaaja mu nsi ya Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bwe yawulira ati Arikelao n'eyali afuga Buyudaaya ng'omusika wa Herode, yaatya okuja eyo. Era bwe yalabulwa mu kirooto yaaja mu biketezo eby'e Galilaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era bwe yatuuka yaatyama mu kibuga ekyetebwa Nazarethi kyatuukirira kityo ekyayogerwa abalanzi kiti: “Alyetebwa Munazarethi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
